DermCompare command-line tool (@neurodesk/derm-compare)
=======================================================

This package is MIT-licensed (LICENSE). It implements sequential digital dermoscopy
alignment and CIEDE2000 change quantification in pure JavaScript:

- Sequential digital dermoscopy monitoring (Kittler et al., JAAD 2000; Arch Dermatol 2006;
  Korotkov & Garcia, Artif Intell Med 2012)
- CIEDE2000 color difference (Sharma, Wu & Dalal, Color Res Appl 2005)
- DullRazor hair suppression (Lee et al., Comput Biol Med 1997)
- Shades of Gray color constancy, p=6 (Finlayson & Trezzi, 2004)
- Otsu lesion border segmentation (Otsu, IEEE TSMC 1979)

Research and educational software — descriptive review thresholds are not standalone
clinical diagnostic criteria.
